# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# .gitignore — yashhooda.ai
# Goal: keep secrets and local junk OUT of git, keep everything the site SHIPS in.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── SECRETS & CREDENTIALS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is the whole reason to care. A leaked .env = leaked API keys = someone
# spending your money. These never get committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example          # a KEY-LESS template is fine to commit as documentation
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
credentials.json
service-account*.json  # e.g. GCP keys — the ONE json family that must be ignored

# Local runner scripts that may contain ADMIN_PASSWORD inline.
# Name any password-bearing .bat like:  run-evals.local.bat
*.local.bat
set-env*.bat

# ── DEPENDENCIES & BUILD OUTPUT ───────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.vercel/
.next/
dist/
build/
.cache/

# ── LOGS & DEBUG ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/

# ── EVAL HARNESS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Timestamped run outputs pile up; ignore them. The CI workflow uploads them as
# build artifacts instead. golden.json + baseline.json stay tracked (see below).
evals/results/

# ── OS / EDITOR CRUFT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/            # remove this line if you want to share workspace settings

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MUST STAY TRACKED — these files SHIP. The negations below are insurance so no
# future pattern can ever accidentally exclude them. DO NOT add a broad *.json rule.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
!public_data_climate_gold.json   # ClimatePulse gold layer, served from repo root
!airports.json                   # aviation tracker lookup table
!evals/golden.json               # eval test set
!evals/baseline.json             # eval reference scores
